DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
31891::$$$message_0249_0000_0000$$$::We don't find anything out of the ordinary in this neighborhood.[lr]::
31892::$$$message_0249_0000_0001$$$::There isn't anyone out on the streets, but it seems otherwise normal.::
31893::$$$message_0249_0001_0000$$$::"There's nothing abnormal...but something feels off, somehow."::
31894::$$$message_0249_0002_0000$$$::Rather, it doesn't quite line up.[lr]::
31895::$$$message_0249_0002_0001$$$::After dinner time in Miyama, houses are lit up as people gather in their living rooms.[lr]::
31896::$$$message_0249_0002_0002$$$::Tonight is no different, but the fact we haven't passed a single person outside feels strange.::
31897::$$$message_0249_0003_0000$$$::"Well, as long as there's no threat. Let's move on."[lr]::
31898::$$$message_0249_0003_0001$$$::We leave the Japanese-style neighborhoods.::
31899::$$$message_0249_0004_0000$$$::"...Oh. Someone just went into that house, Saber. It looked like a father coming home from work."[lr]::
31900::$$$message_0249_0004_0001$$$::I think I spotted a man smoothly entering a house without ringing the doorbell.::
31901::$$$message_0249_0005_0000$$$::"Really? I didn't notice."[lr]::
31902::$$$message_0249_0005_0001$$$::"Maybe you couldn't see it from there. Still, we haven't really seen anyone outside."[lr]::
31903::$$$message_0249_0005_0002$$$::Well, we've come up short, so time to look somewhere else.::

